sangati karma

  -- karma: action — movement that belongs to a substance (dravya).
  -- one of the seven padarthas.
  -- "moves", "rotates", "accelerates" — each is karma of a dravya.
  -- karma-karaka (accusative) is the grammar case for the object of action.

  "padartha-amsha"
  "spanda-swarupa"
  "parampara-sthalam-sthita mula-sthalam-sthita"
  "om-yukta brahma-yukta"
  "brahmam-phala avrti-kriya ananta-sthita"
  "svayambhu-siddha jiva-yukta lekhana-phala"
  "dravya-sthita"
  "guna-pratipaksha"

done
